stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> APPLIED: student applies (eligibility enforced)
    APPLIED --> SHORTLISTED
    APPLIED --> ON_HOLD
    APPLIED --> REJECTED
    APPLIED --> WITHDRAWN
    SHORTLISTED --> INTERVIEW
    SHORTLISTED --> ON_HOLD
    SHORTLISTED --> REJECTED
    SHORTLISTED --> WITHDRAWN
    INTERVIEW --> INTERVIEW: next round
    INTERVIEW --> SELECTED
    INTERVIEW --> ON_HOLD
    INTERVIEW --> REJECTED
    INTERVIEW --> WITHDRAWN
    ON_HOLD --> SHORTLISTED
    ON_HOLD --> INTERVIEW
    ON_HOLD --> SELECTED
    ON_HOLD --> REJECTED
    ON_HOLD --> WITHDRAWN
    SELECTED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
    WITHDRAWN --> [*]
    note right of SELECTED
        Final stages accept no further move.
        Every move writes a stage-history row
        and an audit event.
    end note
